- balance of enemies and weapons;
- more fragments of watches, since earlier it was almost impossible to collect all 12, now it is quite possible to do it :)
- the balance of the spawn of a miner's flashlight and batteries for it;
- balance spawn weapons;
- previously it was possible to pick up an item from any distance - fixed;
- Added several new rooms.

- added an indicator of the health of enemies;
- temporarily removed one of the enemies;
- balanced the power of damage of enemies and the main character;
- added a miner's flashlight, which is worn on the head. Now, if an enemy attacks you in the dark - you will see him, but first find a mining flashlight and batteries for it;
- now, every time, the player will spawn in a random place in the game world;

At the moment, we are engaged in finalizing the gameplay, adding new unique rooms and developing a network game mode!

- added simplified Chinese, Spanish and German;
- fixed bugs with the selection of weapons;
- fixed bugs with taking of some notes.

What's new in 12 HOURS v 1.0:

- localization problem solved;
- solved the problem with failing the floor of the game world;
- added a few new enemies;
- added several types of weapons;
- added unique graffiti;
- new tips;
- new sound effects;
- added a health indicator;
- added new items;
- change, selection and drop of weapons, inventory;
- added more notes with numbers, as it was very difficult to collect 12 hours.

Within a week, v 1.1 update will be released.

- several types of weapons;
- bug fixes;
- work with sounds;
- work with graphics;
- new enemies and dangers;
- new game level.

Now we are all planning and getting down to work in the coming days.
